 by buyers: P_buyer = 26\n   - Price received by sellers: P_seller = 26 - 8 = 18\n   - Tax borne by buyers: P_buyer - P_equilibrium_before_tax = 26 - 20 = 6\n   - Total tax: 8\n   - Fraction borne by buyers: 6 / 8 = 0.75\n\nSo, the fraction of the per-unit tax borne by buyers is 0.75.","reasoning":null,"score":1,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"constraint","constraints":[{"check":"regex","name":"equals 0.75","pattern":"(?<![\\d.])0?\\.750*(?!\\d)"}],"nearMisses":[{"slip":"percent-for-decimal","credit":0.5,"pattern":"(?<![\\d.])75(?:\\.0*)?\\s*%"}]},"breakdown":{"passed":["equals 0.75"],"failed":[],"errored":[]},"timing":{"wall_sec":13.318,"prompt_tokens":89,"generation_tokens":376}},{"item_id":"econ_tax_dwl","prompt_name":"econ_tax_dwl","family":"econ-tax","prior_turn_passed":null,"output":"36","reasoning":null,"score":0,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"exact_match","expected":"24","extract":"(-?\\d[\\d,]*)(?:\\.0+(?!\\d))?"},"timing":{"wall_sec":0.36,"prompt_tokens":78,"generation_tokens":3}},{"item_id":"econ_tax_revenue","prompt_name":"econ_tax_revenue","family":"econ-tax","prior_turn_passed":null,"output":"336","reasoning":null,"score":0,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"exact_match","expected":"592","extract":"(-?\\d[\\d,]*)(?:\\.0+(?!\\d))?"},"timing":{"wall_sec":0.34,"prompt_tokens":76,"generation_tokens":4}},{"item_id":"econ_monopoly_quantity","prompt_name":"econ_monopoly_quantity","family":"econ-monopoly","prior_turn_passed":null,"output":"35","reasoning":null,"score":0,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"exact_match","expected":"30","extract":"(-?\\d[\\d,]*)(?:\\.0+(?!\\d))?"},"timing":{"wall_sec":0.338,"prompt_tokens":93,"generation_tokens":3}},{"item_id":"econ_monopoly_price","prompt_name":"econ_monopoly_price","family":"econ-monopoly","prior_turn_passed":null,"output":"75","reasoning":null,"score":0,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"exact_match","expected":"70","extract":"(-?\\d[\\d,]*)(?:\\.0+(?!\\d))?"},"timing":{"wall_sec":0.287,"prompt_tokens":91,"generation_tokens":3}},{"item_id":"econ_monopoly_profit","prompt_name":"econ_monopoly_profit","family":"econ-monopoly","prior_turn_passed":null,"output":"To find the monopolist's profit, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. **Determine the Marginal Revenue (MR) function:**\n   Given the inverse demand function \\( P = 100 - Q \\), the marginal revenue (MR) function is:\n   \\[\n   MR = 100 - 2Q\n   \\]\n\n2. **Find the equilibrium quantity (Q) where MR = MC:**\n   The marginal cost (MC) function is given as \\( MC = 10 + Q \\).\n   Set MR equal to MC to find the equilibrium quantity:\n   \\[\n   100 - 2Q = 10 + Q\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   100 - 10 = 3Q\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   90 = 3Q\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   Q = 30\n   \\]\n\n3. **Determine the equilibrium price (P):**\n   Substitute \\( Q = 30 \\) back into the demand function:\n   \\[\n   P = 100 - 30 = 70\n   \\]\n\n4. **Calculate the Total Revenue (TR) and Total Cost (TC):**\n   - Total Revenue (TR) is:\n     \\[\n     TR = P \\times Q = 70 \\times 30 = 2100\n     \\]\n   - Total Cost (TC) is the integral of the MC function from 0 to Q:\n     \\[\n     TC = \\int_0^{30} (10 + Q) \\, dQ = 10Q + \\frac{Q^2}{2} \\bigg|_0^{30} = 300 + 450 = 750\n     \\]\n\n5. **Calculate the Profit (π):**\n   \\[\n   \\pi = TR - TC = 2100 - 750 = 1350\n   \\]\n\nThe monopolist's profit is **1350**.","reasoning":null,"score":1,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"exact_match","expected":"1350","extract":"(-?\\d[\\d,]*)(?:\\.0+(?!\\d))?"},"timing":{"wall_sec":15.184,"prompt_tokens":91,"generation_tokens":428}},{"item_id":"econ_monopoly_competitive_quantity","prompt_name":"econ_monopoly_competitive_quantity","family":"econ-monopoly","prior_turn_passed":null,"output":"35","reasoning":null,"score":0,"error":null,"scorer":{"type":"exact_match","expected":"45","extract":"(-?\\d[\\d,]*)(?:\\.0+(?!\\d))?"},"timing":{"wall_sec":0.357,"prompt_tokens":103,"generation_tokens":3}},{"item_id":"econ_monopoly_dwl","prompt_name":"econ_monopoly_dwl","family":"econ-monopoly","prior_turn_p